@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：RocketMQ4 普通消息发送与消费

participant "MessageSendExecutor" as Executor
participant RocketMqMessageProvider as Provider
participant DefaultMQProducer as Producer
queue RocketMQBroker as Broker
participant DefaultMQPushConsumer as PushConsumer
participant CoreListener

== 发送 ==
Executor -> Provider: send(ProviderSendRequest)
Provider -> Provider: Message(topic, body)
Provider -> Provider: properties(headers)
opt messageKey 存在
  Provider -> Provider: setKeys(messageKey)
end
Provider -> Producer: send(message)
Producer -> Broker: Remoting publish
Broker --> Producer: SendResult / exception
Producer --> Provider: send status
Provider --> Executor: ProviderSendResult

== 消费 ==
Broker -> PushConsumer: MessageExt
PushConsumer -> Provider: listener(messageExt)
Provider -> Provider: body + properties + keys
Provider -> CoreListener: onMessage(inbound)
alt SUCCESS
  CoreListener --> Provider: SUCCESS
  Provider --> PushConsumer: CONSUME_SUCCESS
else RETRY / exception
  CoreListener --> Provider: RETRY
  Provider --> PushConsumer: RECONSUME_LATER
end

note over Provider
RocketMQ4 使用 Remoting 客户端。
SEND_OK 才能映射 CONFIRMED；刷盘/主从确认超时类状态更偏 UNKNOWN。
end note
@enduml
